# Foxinburg media routing

Chat/code never go through ApiCodex. Do not run Cursor installers (`/icrm`, `/icrw`).

**Meshy: only REST API** (`https://api.meshy.ai/openapi/v1/...`) with the API key.
Do **not** call Meshy MCP tools (`meshy_*`) — MCP balance is separate/empty; use the key.

| Job | Use |
|-----|-----|
| Text, code, plans, this conversation | Current Cursor agent (you) |
| Production stills / cinematic frames | Meshy REST `POST /openapi/v1/image-to-image` or `text-to-image` with `gpt-image-2-5-flare` or `nano-banana-pro`, `remove_background` when cutout needed. |
| 3D (GLB, remesh, texture, rig) | Meshy REST image-to-3d / related endpoints — preview first, refine after approval. |
| One quick mock in chat | Cursor `GenerateImage` only if they asked to see a preview |

Rules: `n=1` unless they ask for variants. Confirm before extra images, refine, or video. Never print API keys.
